OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FAny overnight showers rain
OL,6,Fquickly clearing to brighter skies,
OL,7,Fwith plenty of hazy spells of sunshine
OL,8,Fdeveloping. An isolated light shower
OL,9,For two may be possible during the
OL,10,Fafternoon. Feeling warm and rather
OL,11,Fmuggy, with light winds.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FA fine evening to come. Cloud
OL,14,Fincreasing overnight from the north,
OL,15,Fwith the promise of some rain moving
OL,16,Fin during the early hours, which may
OL,17,Fbe heavy in places.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
